    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παμ-ποίκῐλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all-variegated, of rich and
				varied work</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.105
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.289
			</span></i>; of sacred vases, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεβρῶν π. στολίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1359
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περὶ πᾶσαν
				τέχνην καὶ πρᾶξιν</span> Vett. Val. <i><span class="en">
				17.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφασμα</span>, of the universe, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.651
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				654
			</span></i>; <i>manifold</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοιότητας
				παμποικίλους </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παμποικίλας</span> codd.) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				82b
			</span></i>.</div>
